<task id="011" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>Intra-paragraph offset-addressing table in the projection (FR-01)</title>
    <phase>1 Backend ingest</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies BFF `.cs` (tags include bff-api); offset→run mapping over formatted/split runs + existing tracked changes is the hardest ingest surface and load-bearing for the Patch Engine — code-review + adr-check MUST run at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>offset→run mapping over formatted/split runs + existing tracked changes is the hardest ingest surface; correctness here determines whether every downstream edit lands (D2 fine anchor). High blast radius across the Patch Engine.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>W1b</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Modifies `ComposeDocxProjectionBuilder.cs` + `ComposeDocxProjection.cs` — both shared with task 012; sequence 011 BEFORE 012.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>001,003</deps>
    <tags>bff-api,docx</tags>
